Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:06.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}To the finish with a flourish there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮地拿下最后一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Didn't she just do so very well to handle a moment{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她处理关键时刻的方式 确实漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.31,0:00:11.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}when 5-3 down in the opening set of this one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}落后 她硬是顶了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:13.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No love lost between these two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这两人之间 早就没了客气
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:25.03,TL,,0,0,0,,去年美网 比赛打完 戏才开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:29.12,TL,,0,0,0,,汤森德{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}赢了奥斯塔彭科
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:32.06,TL,,0,0,0,,握手时 她被堵在网前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:34.57,TL,,0,0,0,,骂“没有风度 没有教养”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:36.23,TL,,0,0,0,,导火索是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.49,0:00:39.67,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘一记擦网弹过网带
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.67,0:00:42.77,TL,,0,0,0,,她拿下那分 却没举手道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.99,0:00:45.31,TL,,0,0,0,,今年温网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:47.98,TL,,0,0,0,,德约又一次擦网得分举手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.19,0:00:52.22,TL,,0,0,0,,阿加西在评论席当场开炮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.69,0:00:53.45,TL,,0,0,0,,"{\fs78}Can{\fs68} {\fs78}we{\fs68} {\fs78}please{\fs68} {\fs78}rally{\fs68} {\fs78}to{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.45,0:00:54.10,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}get{\fs68} {\fs78}rid{\fs68} {\fs78}of{\fs68} {\fs78}that{\fs68} '{\fs78}I{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:54.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}apologise{\fs68} {\fs78}for{\fs68} {\fs78}hitting{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:00:56.30,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}the{\fs68} {\fs78}net{\fs68} {\fs78}cord{\fs68}'?"我们能不能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:59.41,TL,,0,0,0,,把“为擦网道歉”这习俗 废了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:07.86,TL,,0,0,0,,一个动作 有人当面开骂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:09.70,TL,,0,0,0,,名宿喊着废除
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.51,TL,,0,0,0,,可规则书里 没有“对不起”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.09,0:01:16.28,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}先把规则说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:19.31,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}回合中球擦网带过网 落入界内
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:22.11,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}规则第{\fs78}25{\fs68}条 好球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:25.76,TL,,0,0,0,,只有发球擦网才重发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:28.68,TL,,0,0,0,,那这一下手 是谁教的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:30.43,TL,,0,0,0,,没人说得清
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.43,0:01:34.01,TL,,0,0,0,,史家柯林斯说 来自英式绅士年代
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:35.38,TL,,0,0,0,,哈勒普说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:36.54,TL,,0,0,0,,"{\fs78}I{\fs68} {\fs78}was{\fs68} {\fs78}taught{\fs68} {\fs78}as{\fs68} {\fs78}a{\fs68} {\fs78}kid{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:37.33,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}that{\fs68} {\fs78}you{\fs68} {\fs78}have{\fs68} {\fs78}to{\fs68} {\fs78}say{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:38.49,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}sorry{\fs68}.”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:42.09,TL,,0,0,0,,"{\fs78}But{\fs68} {\fs78}I{\fs68} {\fs78}think{\fs68} {\fs78}it{\fs68}'{\fs78}s{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.09,0:01:42.88,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}automatic{\fs68} {\fs78}now{\fs68}"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.03,TL,,0,0,0,,全是自动动作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:48.91,TL,,0,0,0,,动作还分流派
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.91,0:01:52.85,TL,,0,0,0,,摊手的 举拍的 一挥而过的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:55.85,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}先把去年那场架说完整
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.89,0:01:57.44,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.93,TL,,0,0,0,,汤森德一记擦网弹高过网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:02.47,TL,,0,0,0,,对方救回 还是丢了分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.89,0:02:06.38,TL,,0,0,0,,她转身回底线 没举手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:08.93,TL,,0,0,0,,握手时奥斯塔彭科当场发作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:10.76,TL,,0,0,0,,她这样转述
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:15.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Can you fill us in on the conversation you were having with Jelena out there?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能说说你们刚才在场上那番对话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.35,0:02:16.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's competition.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N竞技体育就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:19.85,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}People get upset when they lose.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N输球的人难免上火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:24.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Some people say bad things. She told me I have no class.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N有人会说难听的话 她说我没有风度
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:29.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I have no education, and to see what happens when we get outside the US.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说我没有教养 还说等离开美国再看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:32.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I beat her in Canada, outside the US. I beat her in New York, outside the US.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我在加拿大赢过她 在纽约也赢过她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.05,0:02:32.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So let's see what else she has to say.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看她还有什么可说的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:35.62,TL,,0,0,0,,她说我没风度 没教养
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:37.66,TL,,0,0,0,,奥斯塔彭科在社媒写
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:41.09,TL,,0,0,0,,火来自那记“决定性时刻”的擦网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:43.58,TL,,0,0,0,,"{\fs78}There{\fs68} {\fs78}are{\fs68} {\fs78}some{\fs68} {\fs78}rules{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:44.61,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}in{\fs68} {\fs78}tennis{\fs68} {\fs78}which{\fs68} {\fs78}most{\fs68} {\fs78}of{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.61,0:02:45.92,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}the{\fs68} {\fs78}players{\fs68} {\fs78}follow{\fs68}."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:46.63,TL,,0,0,0,,她说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:49.95,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她生涯第一次遇上有人不道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:59.06,TL,,0,0,0,,大坂直美公开批评她 舆论连吵几天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.69,0:03:01.72,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}天后 她发文道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:04.65,TL,,0,0,0,,英语非母语 “教养”指礼仪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.61,TL,,0,0,0,,汤森德接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:09.95,TL,,0,0,0,,不止她讨过这声“对不起”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.95,0:03:13.18,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年 梅德韦杰夫赢下西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:14.89,TL,,0,0,0,,握手第一句
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:22.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quite a start on the year as a 2-6, 6-4, 6-2 win, and some words.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N逆转取胜 还附带一番口角
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.85,0:03:24.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You don't say sorry, you think you're a good kid?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你不道歉 还觉得自己是个好孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.19,0:03:27.45,TL,,0,0,0,,另一边火力同样不弱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.45,0:03:29.85,TL,,0,0,0,,阿加西后半句更狠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:31.05,TL,,0,0,0,,"{\fs78}If{\fs68} {\fs78}you{\fs68} {\fs78}hit{\fs68} {\fs78}the{\fs68} {\fs78}net{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.05,0:03:31.83,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}cord{\fs68} {\fs78}and{\fs68} {\fs78}it{\fs68} {\fs78}doesn{\fs68}'{\fs78}t{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:32.32,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}go{\fs68} {\fs78}over{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.07,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}I{\fs68} {\fs78}don{\fs68}'{\fs78}t{\fs68} {\fs78}see{\fs68} {\fs78}the{\fs68} {\fs78}other{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:34.31,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}person{\fs68} {\fs78}apologising{\fs68}."没
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.31,0:03:37.74,TL,,0,0,0,,人跟你道歉 这动作 天生单向
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:46.39,TL,,0,0,0,,那举手的人图什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:48.11,TL,,0,0,0,,莎拉波娃说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:48.95,TL,,0,0,0,,"{\fs78}I{\fs68}'{\fs78}m{\fs68} {\fs78}sorry{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:49.66,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}because{\fs68} {\fs78}I{\fs68}'{\fs78}d{\fs68} {\fs78}rather{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:50.56,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}have{\fs68} {\fs78}finished{\fs68} {\fs78}it{\fs68} {\fs78}on{\fs68} {\fs78}a{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:52.23,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}outright{\fs68} {\fs78}winner{\fs68}."我道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:03:54.77,TL,,0,0,0,,是因为我宁愿用一记干干净净的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:57.17,TL,,0,0,0,,制胜分 结束这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:05.39,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}别忘了 争论的起点是球本身
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.89,0:04:09.54,TL,,0,0,0,,有些擦网 擦掉的不是一分 是历史
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:11.95,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1989{\fs68}年法网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.95,0:04:14.99,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}17{\fs68}岁的张德培对世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}伦德尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.99,0:04:18.20,TL,,0,0,0,,第五盘他抽筋到走不动 却在{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:21.30,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}30{\fs68}时打出一记下手发球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:23.02,TL,,0,0,0,,伦德尔被引到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:25.83,TL,,0,0,0,,穿越球擦着网带爬了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:31.22,TL,,0,0,0,,赛点上 伦德尔二发又擦到网带
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:34.08,TL,,0,0,0,,弹出界外 双误 比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:36.55,TL,,0,0,0,,同一场 网带先帮张德培一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:38.69,TL,,0,0,0,,最后又替他收了尾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:49.89,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:51.79,TL,,0,0,0,,蒂姆淘汰纳达尔那场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:55.33,TL,,0,0,0,,擦网得分至少{\fs78}5{\fs68}次 举手也{\fs78}5{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.39,0:04:59.14,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次是真心 第五次呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:01.19,TL,,0,0,0,,画面自己会问
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:04.15,TL,,0,0,0,,没人能练擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:06.39,TL,,0,0,0,,它不认排名 不认苦练
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:08.42,TL,,0,0,0,,只认那条白带
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:11.15,TL,,0,0,0,,所以这声“对不起”是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:14.53,TL,,0,0,0,,废除派说虚伪 坚守派说体面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:18.19,TL,,0,0,0,,省掉它的人被堵着讨说法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:20.82,TL,,0,0,0,,做足的人只想着下一分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:24.08,TL,,0,0,0,,没人真信 它却活了{\fs78}100{\fs68}多年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:26.63,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2007{\fs68}年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:28.48,TL,,0,0,0,,索德林擦网得分没致歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:31.41,TL,,0,0,0,,还振臂庆祝 被纳达尔批评
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:33.97,TL,,0,0,0,,"{\fs78}Why{\fs68} {\fs78}should{\fs68} {\fs78}I{\fs68} {\fs78}say{\fs68} {\fs78}I{\fs68}'{\fs78}m{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.97,0:05:34.62,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}sorry{\fs68} {\fs78}when{\fs68} {\fs78}it{\fs68}'{\fs78}s{\fs68} {\fs78}the{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:35.45,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}happiest{\fs68} {\fs78}moment{\fs68} {\fs78}of{\fs68} {\fs78}my{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:37.82,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}life{\fs68}?"我人生最幸福的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:39.84,TL,,0,0,0,,为什么要说对不起？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:48.54,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}那么你说 擦网得分举起的那只手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:50.73,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}是礼貌还是演戏？
